					},
					"reach": "1,2",
					"parry": "0",
					"strength": "10",
					"usage": "Swing",
					"usage_notes": "The hooked head can be used to make a Grapple attempt in place of damage (Basic Set grappling/takedown rules, GM's discretion on the exact maneuver) - a Grabba Stikk's whole point is dragging a target off its feet, out of cover, or off a trukk.",
